| ID | Work | Acceptance |
|----|------|------------|
| P1 | Strict import validation | reject bad JSON |
| P2 | CRUD UI | offline edit |
| P3 | Seeds + docs | 3 RW ports |
| P4 | Secrets store + export exclude | no leak via export |

